  offerLine: My kawakawa scroll recipe... the wind took it, and it tore into four. One blew into the bush. I'd bet that weka has another.
  activeLine: Any luck with the scraps? Try the bush, and ask around the neighbours.
  readyLine: All four! Let me piece them together...
  doneLine: The kawakawa scroll is yours now. Make the village proud.
